<title>INDIA: INDIA RBI MAINTAINS REPO CUT-OFF AT 3.60 PCT.</title>
<headline>INDIA RBI MAINTAINS REPO CUT-OFF AT 3.60 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off rate at 3.60 percent at its repo auction on Thursday.</p>
</text>
